1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,972
The office opens the exam and chooses Enter grades.

2
00:00:03,972 --> 00:00:08,372
Pick a section. Every subject and paper has its own tab.

3
00:00:08,372 --> 00:00:26,321
Type the section’s marks. Converted (a), (b), total and grade are calculated as you go.

4
00:00:26,321 --> 00:00:29,583
Save — Mathematics is complete for all 12 students.

5
00:00:29,583 --> 00:00:39,217
Add attendance and the class teacher’s remarks.

6
00:00:39,217 --> 00:00:48,906
The summary shows every subject, the GPA and each student’s position.

7
00:00:48,906 --> 00:00:52,839
Process the results — as a draft first, publish when ready.

8
00:00:52,839 --> 00:01:04,754
The report card, in the school’s own format — ready to print or share.
